  "lead": "I&#x27;m David Geha, an AI consultant in Beirut. For a boutique 360° marketing agency in Hazmieh, I built one in-house AI agent that covers 5 roles: brand strategist, competitor researcher, SEO and GEO scorer, operations dispatcher and writing partner. It has been in production since July 2026.",
